210
00:13:06.869 --> 00:13:07.745
Dalhin ito sa.

211
00:13:08.704 --> 00:13:09.872
Humanda nang gumulong, guys.

212
00:13:09.955 --> 00:13:11.290
-Handa…
-Tara na.

213
00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:13.042
Magtatrabaho tayo bilang isang team

214
00:13:13.125 --> 00:13:15.044
